  "description": "You might need a fork and knife or a few napkins for this one. Notes: I usually make 12 2 1/2-inch biscuits with this recipe, but since these are breakfast sandwiches, I like to go a bit bigger with them....",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: buttermilk → plain low-fat yogurt\n\nNotes: I usually make twelve 2 1/2-inch biscuits with this recipe, but since these are breakfast sandwiches, I like to go a bit bigger with them. You may have a few leftover, but I'm sure there will be no complaints.\nThe recipe is easily halved.\nMy preferred Canadian bacon is Applegate brand.",
